{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281120","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028112001:1":{"text":"마력을 흡수할 준비는 다 마쳤어요.","source_cn":"我已经准备好吸收散逸的魔力了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x508F7AC8F703F972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1028112001":{"text":"마력을 흡수할 준비는 다 마쳤어요.","source_cn":"我已经准备好吸收散逸的魔力了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x508F7AC8F703F972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028112002:0":{"text":"으르릉... 컹!","source_cn":"吼……吼……吼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5610C76A2D206156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028112003:0":{"text":"미안해... 내가 방해했니?","source_cn":"对不起……我打扰到你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x401DA76D403ABA8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028112004:0":{"text":"...앗, 다쳤구나... 곰돌이 씨, 내가 치료해줄까? 자세히 살펴봐도 되니?","source_cn":"……咦，你受伤了……熊先生，可以让我来治疗吗？我，能不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E19A95E7CBEC49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028112005:1":{"text":"크릉...","source_cn":"吼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C43CCAC1E8149C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028112006:0":{"text":"상처가 심해서 힘들었겠구나... 내가 치료해줄게. 비에 조금 젖을지도 몰라... 하지만 걱정하지 마, 상처는 안 아플 거야.","source_cn":"伤得好重，一定很难受吧……我要治疗了，可能会让你淋一点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4AF1BB6EEC776B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028112007:0":{"text":"괜찮아, 금방 나을 거야... 봐, 벌써 아물기 시작했어!","source_cn":"别着急，马上就好……瞧，已经开始愈合了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD990965176CF9AA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028112008:0":{"text":"으르르.... 뀨우...","source_cn":"吼……咕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07FE7EB7F6E217BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028112009:0":{"text":"이 꿀은...? 나한테 주는 거야?","source_cn":"这些蜂蜜是……？都是给我的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C0F9FB9E0C35FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028112010:0":{"text":"...정말 달콤해! 고마워, 곰돌이 씨!","source_cn":"……真甜！谢谢你，熊先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ABE54886EC21B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028112011:0":{"text":"맞다, 난 휴윈이라고 해. 곰돌이 씨는 이름이 있어?","source_cn":"对了，我叫伊温，你有名字吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F4377E4260BA32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028112012:1":{"text":"뀨우...우?","source_cn":"吼……呼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C877C41A5AF8828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028112013:0":{"text":"이름이 없구나... 그럼 “이르군”이라고 불러도 될까? 이르군, 숲의 “큰 친구”라는 뜻이야!","source_cn":"没有名字啊……那我叫你“伊尔贡”好不好？伊尔贡，丛林里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33E8E32798C10161","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028112014:1":{"text":"뀨뀨르!","source_cn":"咕噜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C9F004F6E69CFE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028112015:0":{"text":"이것도 선물이야? 정말 예쁜 잎사귀네... 고마워, 이르군!","source_cn":"这也是送给我的吗？好漂亮的叶子……谢谢，伊尔贡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE5F8FB5C26DACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028112016:0":{"text":"우린... 이제 친구 맞지? 우린 친구야!","source_cn":"我们……是朋友了，对吧？我们是朋友了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB069F6142468A980","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028112017:1":{"text":"쿠릉... 뀨... 뀨우....","source_cn":"咕噜……吼……咕噜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB18013894A5BDCE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028112018:0":{"text":"내가... 쓰다듬어줄까? 아, 푹신푹신해. 귀여워...","source_cn":"你想……让我摸摸你？哈，毛绒绒的，好可爱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7F1CF50A03C862E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1028112019:0":{"text":"...응? 끝났나요? 이번엔 몬스터도 없이 순조롭게 잘...","source_cn":"……咦，结束了？这次很顺利嘛，没有魔物来侵扰——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E3CF602A380379B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1028112020:2":{"text":"크아앙!","source_cn":"吼……噢噢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B46411A3CAD671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1028112020":{"text":"크아앙!","source_cn":"吼……噢噢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B46411A3CAD671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1028112021:0":{"text":"치피는 그냥 해본 말인데... 이건, 치피 탓이 아니라고요!","source_cn":"满满就是随便说说……这、这可不能怪满满呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD964CBEA71F4263","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1028112022:0":{"text":"휴윈 양, 걱정하지 마세요. 우리가 지켜줄게요!","source_cn":"伊温小姐，不要担心，我们会保护你的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA93C92630D7A7A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:0:1":{"text":"전투 준비!","source_cn":"准备战斗！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDF786CE1E9B2FEF9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전투 준비!","female":"전투 준비!","variant_male_record_index":"61192","variant_female_record_index":"61193","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:1:2":{"text":"치피, 돗자리 펴도 되겠어","source_cn":"满满，你去当预言家吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C207AA921BEADB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"치피, 돗자리 펴도 되겠어","female":"치피, 돗자리 펴도 되겠어","variant_male_record_index":"61194","variant_female_record_index":"61195","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"(기억의 조각 활성화)","source_cn":"（激活记忆碎片）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFE69F9A02CB34892","variant_status":"runtime_gender_k